<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NEWBRIDGE NETWORKS CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NEWBRIDGE NETWORKS CUT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Nikos Theodosopoulos downgraded Newbridge Networks Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said stock had hit price target and there are &quot;now near-term issues with the LAN business.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said in a report company's decision to move into LAN market will &quot;in the long-term allow the company to offer end-to-end one-stop shop networking solution to both enterprise and carrier customers.&quot;</p>
<p>-- but said &quot;we believe it will take time and money to achieve this goal.&quot;</p>
</text>
